        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Nice variety of stores from restaurants to convenience stores. Lots of parking available at all times and snow removal is handled well. Sidewalks are kept clean in the winter and each store is in walking distance. The most notable store here is the Indian restaurant which has fantastic food, good portions and is fairly priced.",
