        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "great little strip mall has a bunch of resto and stores in it that we frequent pretty often. It's nice to have all this located in close proximity, I hate going into giant malls strip malls like these are a dying breed and I really enjoy them for the ease and comfort of going in the specific store I need to",
